is, I don't define the grind

00:25:58.583 --> 00:26:01.125
or the hustle in any
different words, like,

00:26:01.125 --> 00:26:03.750
I think we're getting
too caught up in words,

00:26:03.750 --> 00:26:06.041
especially my community,
we're trying to define all

00:26:06.041 --> 00:26:09.583
these things, you can
call it, use the adjective,

00:26:09.583 --> 00:26:12.959
that you want, I think
nobody should be confused,

00:26:12.959 --> 00:26:15.959
I think it's a great
parlay off of what you said.

00:26:15.959 --> 00:26:18.417
I'm trying to show people
the reason I do a daily vlog

00:26:18.417 --> 00:26:20.333
is sure, I'm narcissistic
and want it on tape

00:26:20.333 --> 00:26:22.166
and all that stuff and
it builds a brand and it'll

00:26:22.166 --> 00:26:25.417
be fun to look at when I'm
80, but more than anything,

00:26:25.417 --> 00:26:29.250
I'm suffocating out anybody's
excuse of what hard work

00:26:29.250 --> 00:26:32.250
actually looks like, it's on
tape now, it's black and white.

00:26:32.250 --> 00:26:35.625
There's no more debate, you
guys see it and by the way

00:26:35.625 --> 00:26:39.959
I'm so thrilled to do this
literally for 28 straight years

00:26:39.959 --> 00:26:42.625
so that it's so mundane
and boring it's the same old

00:26:42.625 --> 00:26:45.208
grind and hustle, same old
thing, and so whether you use

00:26:45.208 --> 00:26:48.333
the word grind or hustle or
work, a lot of people are like,

00:26:48.333 --> 00:26:51.000
"Gary, you shouldn't use crush
it anymore, it's played out,

00:26:51.000 --> 00:26:53.291
"use this, or I don't
like the word hustle,

00:26:53.291 --> 00:26:54.417
"it can mean like..."

00:26:54.417 --> 00:26:57.792
I mean, to debate the word,
the semantics of that shit is

00:26:57.792 --> 00:27:01.458
such a waste of time, just
do the action, you understand

00:27:01.458 --> 00:27:03.834
what it is, if you're
debating the word and trying to

00:27:03.834 --> 00:27:06.667
have those conversations,
that's the excuse to buy time

00:27:06.667 --> 00:27:07.500
- You're wasting
time yeah (laughing)

00:27:07.500 --> 00:27:10.333
- to not actually do
it, that's exactly right.

